ARM MP+dmb+addr
"Reader has an address dependency between the two loads; writer is fenced.
 Forbidden by ARM (dependency preserved), allowed by bare Coherence (deps ignored)."
{ 0:r1=x; 0:r3=y; 1:r1=y; 1:r3=x; }
 P0           | P1            ;
 MOV r0,#1    | LDR r0,[r1]   ;
 STR r0,[r1]  | EOR r2,r0,r0  ;
 DMB          | LDR r4,[r3,r2];
 MOV r2,#1    |               ;
 STR r2,[r3]  |               ;
exists (1:r0=1 /\ 1:r4=0)
